        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions CFRBS Smooth Refrigerator Door Pull</b>\r\n<p>\r\nElegance from this simple design makes this appliance pull a very popular choice when dressing up freezers and refrigerators.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIt is packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator / appliance door panel. Although this Appliance Pull is available in several lengths, we believe a refrigerator needs to have an 18\" or longer pull installed to effectively pull open todays large \"vacuum\" sealed doors such as the ones found on a Sub Zero refrigerator. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for  First Impressions CFRBS Smooth Appliance Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: High Quality Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for appliance panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4  standard lengths.</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBS-9: Total Length 9\" - Center to Center Mount - 6\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBS-12: Total Length 12\" - Center to Center Mount - 8\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBS-18: Total Length 18\" - Center to Center Mount - 12\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-CFRBS-24: Total Length 24\" - Center to Center Mount - 18\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This appliance handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the appliance handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with mounting screws for a standard 3/4\" thick  refrigerator/appliance door panel.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>* Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Style Smooth Appliance Pull, First Impressions CFRBS",
                "description": "First Impressions CFRBS appliance pulls. Elegance from the simple  modest design make this  appliance pull a very popular choice when dressing up freezers and refrigerators. Available in 9 different finish colors and 4 different lengths up to 24 inches.",
